  "description": "\"On this day, six years from now you will die. Della Limiere, because you are the villainess of this novel.\"\n\nEnvious of the opportunities she never had as a girl and eager to learn about new things, Della hears a shocking prophecy from Lissha. She must change her fate and marry a supporting character in order to survive.\n\nBut why is the emperor threatening this guy and why was he almost assassinated...? Is he really just a supporting character? Then fate takes a turn, and the truth becomes a lie...Will Della survive to the end?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9791686), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/one_day_), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/oneday_villainess_said), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000058355)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/the-villainess-once-said?seriesId=4211), [Japanese](https://www.comico.jp/comic/10088), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000733), [Thai](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B6%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%94%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%89/1020)",
